<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 57,200 MT were off 54 percent from the previous week and the 4-week average.  Major increases for Japan (38,700 MT) and Mexico (27,300 MT) were partly offset by decreases for Israel (15,900 MT) and unknown destinations (4,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 127,400 MT improved 28 percent from the prior week and 23 percent from the 4-week average.  The major destination was Japan (78,700 MT).</p>
</text>
